    "detailed_description": "The NightCity at night is a hoverbike racing arena. Have fun in 43 levels, gaining speed upgrades, shock powerups to slow other racers, repairing powerups and rockets to shoot kamikaze drones.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSimplified controls make it possible for everyone to fly. Just go up and down, turn left and right.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAt the end of the 40 levels, 3 time challenges are available for unlimited gameplay.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSwitch to the first person view for more immersive gameplay.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlays best with a controller! The right stick used for steering left and right is very sensitive. It will be needed later, when racing becomes more extreme.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;NightHover&quot; is also available now for free in Google Play on Android. Steering on Android is done by turning the phone like a steering wheel. You might want to try it, if you do not like a keyboard or a controller.",
